* {{rhymes|fr|a|s=1}}
* {{homophones|fr|foi|foie|foies}}
* {{hyphenation|fr|fois}}

===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|fr|frm|foys}}, from {{inh|fr|fro|foiz}}, from earlier {{m|fro|feiz}}, from {{inh|fr|la|vicis|vicem}}. The reason for the development of an initial /f/, instead of the expected /v/, is not entirely clear. It may be the result of voicing assimilation to the final consonants of numerals such as {{m|fro|deus|t=two}} or {{m|fro|set|t=seven}}, which would have often preceded the word.<ref>{{R:fr:TLFi}}</ref> Cognate with {{cog|pt|-}} and {{cog|es|vez}}.

====Noun====
{{fr-noun|f}}

# [[time]] {{gloss|an instance or repetition of something happening}}
#: {{ux|fr|J'y vais deux fois par mois.|I go there twice a month.}}
#: {{ux|fr|Je lui ai parlé pour la première fois il y a des années.|I talked to him for the first time a few years ago.}}
# {{lb|fr|arithmetic}} [[times]], multiplied by

